  "text": "Voter Information & Resources | Robeson County Administration\ntop of page\nROBESON COUNTY\nNorth Carolina\n-\nOfficial Site |\nNews/BIds\n|\nNOTICE OF DATA EVENT\nDEPARTMENTS A-J\nAdministration & Commissioners\nAttorney\nRoads\nBoard of Elections\nPolitical Signage\nCommunity Development\nFleet Operations\nContractors List\nE-911\nComputer Operations\nCooperative Extensions\nEmergency Management\nEconomic Development\nEMS\nFinance\nGIS System Online-Robeson County\nHealth Department\nHousing Authority\nNC Housing Finance Agency\u2019s Essential\nHuman Resources\nCareer Opportunities\nJail Health\nJuvenile Restitution\nDEPARTMENTS O-Z\nOffender Resources\nPublic Utilities\nParks & Recreation\nParks & Recreation Camps\nRegistation for Special Needs Baseball\nPublic Buildings\nPurchasing\nRegister of Deeds\nSEATS\nSheriff's Office\nSocial Services\nSoild Waste\nLittle Litter Eliminator\nSoil and Water\nTaxes\nRates/County/Fire\nProperty Tax Laws\nBoard of Equalization\nAppealing Tax Values\nPersonal Property\nBusiness Personal Property\nInstructions\nRegistered Motor Vehicle Tax\nTax Staff & Divisions\nTax Tutorial\nTax FAQ\nVeteran Services\nWater Department\nEye On Water\nWellness Department\nBOARD MEETINGS\nSERVICES\nAccessibility\nRobeson County Ordinances\nPay Taxes Online\nPay Water Bill Online\nView Deed Info Online\nAccess Robeson GIS System Online\nCareers with Robeson County\nCDBG-DR\nContact Managers / Commissioners\nKeep Robeson Clean\nMake a Suggestion\nCONTACT\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nVoter Information & Resources\nVoter Photo ID Requirement\nUOCAVA Election Notice\nNC Buffer Zone Notice 2026 General Election\nAbsentee Ballot Request form with Instructions\nPolitical Signage\nStep by Step Early Voting Totals\nOfficial Election Notice\nBOE Notices\nWeather Policy\nSample Ballots\nTo search your ballot, use the Voter Search Tool\nCONTACT INFORMATION:\nPhysical Address:\n800 N. Walnut Street\nLumberton, NC. 28358\nMailing Address:\nP. O. Box 2159\nLumberton, NC 28359\n\u200b\nEmail\nboe@robesoncountync.gov\nOffice Telephone:\n910-671-3080\nFax Telephone:\n910-737-5094\nOffice Hours:\n(Monday-Friday)\n8:15 am \u2013 5:15 pm\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nRobeson County BOE Links:\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nElected Officials Booklet\n\u200b\nAnswers to Voter FAQs about Ballot Tabulation\n\u200b\nA\nnswers for Precinct Officials to FAQs about Ballot Tabulation\n\u200b\nRegister to Vote in Robeson County (English or Spanish)\n\u200b\nHandout for How NC Secure Election For Voters\n\u200b\n\u200b\nElection Day Polling Place Search\n\u200b\nExternal Links:\n\u200b\nInformation about Absentee Voting\nhttps://www.ncsbe.gov/\n\u200b\nEarly Voting Polling Place Seach\nhttps://www.ncsbe.gov/\n\u200b\nCombating Misinformation\n:\nhttps://www.ncsbe.gov/about-elections/election-security/combating-misinformation\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nSTAFF:\nDirector\n-\nJessica Davis\nEmail:\njessica.davis@robesoncountync.gov\nAdministrative Specialist-Lindsey Locklear\nEmail: l\nindsey.locklear@robesoncountync.gov\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nVoter Registration Tech - Tina Canady\nEmail:\ntina.canady\n@\nrobesoncountync.gov\nElections Deputy - Horace Locklear Jr. Email:\nhorace.locklear\n@\nrobesoncountync.gov\nElections Deputy\n- Krystal Epps\nEmail:\nkrystal.Epps\n@\nrobesoncountync.gov\nElections Deputy\n- Summer Hunt\nEmail:\nsummer.hunt\n@\nrobesoncountync.gov\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nB\nOARD MEMBERS:\n\u200b\nLeft to right is Wendy Pridgen, Gretchen Lutz (Chair), Marion Thompson (Secretary), and Tim Heath\n\u200b\nGretchen Lutz, Chair\nAppointed by NC State Auditor\ngretchen.lutz@robesoncountync.gov\nMarion Thompson, Secretary\nAppointed by NC State Board of Elections\nmarion.thompson@robesoncountync.gov\nTim Heath, Member\nAppointed by NC State Board of Elections\ntim.heath@robesoncountync.gov\n\u200b\nWendy Pridgen, Member\nAppointed by NC State Board of Elections\nwendy.pridgen@robesoncountync.gov\n\u200b\nSteve Stone, Member\nAppointed by the NC State Board of Elections\nsteve.stone@robesoncountync.gov\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200bRobeson County Board of Elections meets, for regular meetings, on the 3rd Tuesday of each month at the Robeson BOE Office, 800 North Walnut Street, Lumberton, NC 28358\nRegular Scheduled Meetings may be canceled or rescheduled as needed.\n\u200bAbsentee meetings, all other pre-election and canvass meetings may have alternate times.\n\u200b\nPlease refer to schedule of meetings, and Board of Elections Notices for updates.\n\u200b\nIf you wish to speak during a meeting, please call\n910-671-3080 and speak to the Director about being added to the Agenda.\n\u200b\nSchedule of meetings, for the 2026 General Election\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nAbsentee Meeting #1 September 29, 2026 5:30\n\u200b\n\u200b\nAbsentee Meeting #2 October 6, 2026 5:30\n\u200b\nAbsentee Meeting #3 October 13, 2026 5:30\nAbsentee Meeting #4 October 20, 2026 5:30\n\u200b\nAbsentee Meeting #5 October 27, 2026 5:30\n\u200b\nPre-Election Absentee Meeting November 02, 2026 5:30pm\n\u200b\n\u200b\nElection Day/ Absentee Ballot Count November 10, 2026 10:00 am-5:00pm\nPolls Close 7:30 pm\nAbsentee/Provisional Final Count November 10, 2026 10:00am\nCounty Canvass November 13, 2026 11:00am\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\n\u200b\nNotices\nSTAY CONNECTED - SIGN UP WITH\nROBESON COUNTY, NC\nCONTACT\nhttps://www.instagram.com/robesongov/\nRobeson County. NC\n550 North Chestnut Street\nLumberton, NC 28358\n\u200b\n\u200b\nOPENING HOURS\nMonday \u2013 Friday 8:30 AM \u2013 5:00 PM\n\u200b\nBlogs\nNotice of Rights Under HAWKINS v. COHEN\nRobeson County Water Report\nRobeson County Water Notice\nComprehensive Plan\nADA Accessibility Information\nRobeson County RPO's Title VI Policy\n2025 Annual Water Report\nCopyright \u00a9 Robeson County. | 550 North Chestnut Street Lumberton, North Carolina 28358 | Robeson County Privacy Policy\nbottom of page",
